  "id": "template",
  "name": "Hospital ransomware",
  "description": "A regional hospital's network is encrypted mid-shift. Clinical systems fail one after another while the teams decide whether to isolate the network, how to keep patients safe, and whether to pay. Topology view; about 100 minutes.",
